  "assumptions": [
    "Sunflower, Moonflower and Wild Rose quantity multipliers are unknown on the wiki and set to 1.",
    "ANY_CROP and Any Two/Three Crops draw from the ten classic crop families (WHEAT, CARROT, POTATO, PUMPKIN, SUGAR_CANE, MELON, CACTUS, COCOA_BEANS, MUSHROOM, NETHER_WART); flowers and raw meats are excluded.",
    "Every Enchanted tier is 160 of the previous one (five slots of 32, SkyBlockRecipe.getStandardEnchantedRecipe); Hay Bale, Baked Potato, Polished Pumpkin, Enchanted Sugar Cane, Mutant Nether Wart, Compacted flowers, Cooked Mutton, Grilled Pork and Cooked Rabbit are therefore 25,600 raw.",
    "Bread is taken as 3 Wheat (vanilla recipe) and Enchanted Bread as 160 Bread = 480 raw following the repo recipe (item_id BREAD); real Hypixel Enchanted Bread is 60 Wheat, so the repo is 8x costlier per item.",
    "Golden Carrot counts as 1 raw Carrot (vanilla 8 gold nuggets + carrot); Enchanted Golden Carrot = 160 Golden Carrot = 160 raw.",
